---
/**
 * Privacy Policy.
 *
 * Written to match what the system actually does. When the product gains a
 * capability that touches personal data — a new notification channel, a new
 * third party, a new field captured from a shopper — this page has to change
 * with it. It fell a long way behind once already: the online shop, delivery
 * and the chat assistant all shipped while this still described merchant data
 * only.
 *
 * NOT reviewed by a lawyer. The subprocessor list and the controller/processor
 * split in particular should be checked against Tanzania's Personal Data
 * Protection Act, 2022 before being relied on.
 */
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
---
<LegalLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — BiasharaPOS"
  description="How BiasharaPOS collects, uses and protects the data of merchants in Tanzania and of the customers who order from their online shops."
  path="/privacy"
  heading="Privacy Policy"
  headingSw="Sera ya Faragha"
  updated="4 October 2026"
>
  <p data-en="This Privacy Policy explains how BiasharaPOS (“we”, “us”, “our”) collects, uses and safeguards information when you use our point-of-sale application, website and related services (the “Service”). By using the Service you agree to the practices described here." data-sw="Sera hii ya Faragha inaeleza jinsi BiasharaPOS (“sisi”, “yetu”) inavyokusanya, kutumia na kulinda taarifa unapotumia programu yetu ya mauzo, tovuti na huduma zinazohusiana (“Huduma”). Kwa kutumia Huduma unakubali matumizi yaliyoelezwa hapa.">This Privacy Policy explains how BiasharaPOS (“we”, “us”, “our”) collects, uses and safeguards information when you use our point-of-sale application, website and related services (the “Service”). By using the Service you agree to the practices described here.</p>

  <h2 data-en="Two kinds of people this covers" data-sw="Makundi mawili ya watu yanayohusika">Two kinds of people this covers</h2>
  <p data-en="If you are a business using BiasharaPOS, we hold your data and this policy describes what we do with it. If you are someone who ordered from a shop running on BiasharaPOS, that shop decides what happens to your details — we hold them on the shop’s behalf. Ask the shop you ordered from first; we will help them answer you." data-sw="Kama wewe ni biashara inayotumia BiasharaPOS, sisi tunahifadhi data yako na sera hii inaeleza tunachofanya nayo. Kama wewe ni mtu aliyeagiza kutoka duka linalotumia BiasharaPOS, duka hilo ndilo linaloamua nini kinatokea kwa taarifa zako — sisi tunazihifadhi kwa niaba ya duka. Muulize kwanza duka ulilonunua; tutawasaidia kukujibu.">If you are a business using BiasharaPOS, we hold your data and this policy describes what we do with it. If you are someone who ordered from a shop running on BiasharaPOS, that shop decides what happens to your details — we hold them on the shop’s behalf. Ask the shop you ordered from first; we will help them answer you.</p>

  <h2 data-en="Information we collect" data-sw="Taarifa tunazokusanya">Information we collect</h2>
  <p data-en="From businesses using the Service:" data-sw="Kutoka kwa biashara zinazotumia Huduma:">From businesses using the Service:</p>
  <ul>
    <li data-en="Account details — your name, business name, phone number and email address when you register." data-sw="Maelezo ya akaunti — jina lako, jina la biashara, namba ya simu na barua pepe unapojisajili.">Account details — your name, business name, phone number and email address when you register.</li>
    <li data-en="Business data — products, prices, inventory, sales records and the fiscal receipts you generate." data-sw="Data ya biashara — bidhaa, bei, hesabu ya bidhaa, kumbukumbu za mauzo na risiti za kodi unazozalisha.">Business data — products, prices, inventory, sales records and the fiscal receipts you generate.</li>
    <li data-en="Staff records — the users you create, their roles, and the till shifts and actions recorded against them." data-sw="Kumbukumbu za wafanyakazi — watumiaji unaowaunda, majukumu yao, na zamu za kaunta na vitendo vilivyorekodiwa kwao.">Staff records — the users you create, their roles, and the till shifts and actions recorded against them.</li>
    <li data-en="Usage data — device type, app version and basic analytics that help us improve the Service." data-sw="Data ya matumizi — aina ya kifaa, toleo la programu na takwimu za msingi zinazotusaidia kuboresha Huduma.">Usage data — device type, app version and basic analytics that help us improve the Service.</li>
  </ul>
  <p data-en="From people ordering on a shop’s online storefront, on that shop’s behalf:" data-sw="Kutoka kwa watu wanaoagiza kwenye duka la mtandaoni, kwa niaba ya duka hilo:">From people ordering on a shop’s online storefront, on that shop’s behalf:</p>
  <ul>
    <li data-en="Order details — your name, phone number, what you ordered and, for delivery, your address and any landmark you give." data-sw="Maelezo ya oda — jina lako, namba ya simu, ulichoagiza na, kwa usafirishaji, anwani yako na alama yoyote unayotoa.">Order details — your name, phone number, what you ordered and, for delivery, your address and any landmark you give.</li>
    <li data-en="Proof of delivery — the name of whoever received the order and, where a signature is used instead of the handover code, that signature." data-sw="Uthibitisho wa kupokea — jina la aliyepokea oda na, pale saini inapotumika badala ya namba ya kupokea, saini hiyo.">Proof of delivery — the name of whoever received the order and, where a signature is used instead of the handover code, that signature.</li>
    <li data-en="Messages — the text messages we send you about your order, and whether you have asked us to stop sending them." data-sw="Ujumbe — ujumbe tunaokutumia kuhusu oda yako, na kama umetuomba tuache kukutumia.">Messages — the text messages we send you about your order, and whether you have asked us to stop sending them.</li>
  </ul>
  <p data-en="You do not need an account to order from a shop. We do not ask shoppers for a password, and we do not build a profile of you across different shops." data-sw="Huhitaji akaunti ili kuagiza kutoka duka. Hatuwaombi wanunuzi nenosiri, na hatujengi wasifu wako kwenye maduka tofauti.">You do not need an account to order from a shop. We do not ask shoppers for a password, and we do not build a profile of you across different shops.</p>

  <h2 data-en="How we use your information" data-sw="Jinsi tunavyotumia taarifa zako">How we use your information</h2>
  <p data-en="We use your information to operate the Service, record sales, generate fiscal receipts built to the TRA VFD specification, pass orders between a shop and its customers, provide customer support, send important service notices and improve our features. We do not sell your personal or business data to third parties, and we do not use it to advertise to you." data-sw="Tunatumia taarifa zako kuendesha Huduma, kurekodi mauzo, kuzalisha risiti za kodi zilizojengwa kwa maelekezo ya TRA VFD, kupitisha oda kati ya duka na wateja wake, kutoa msaada kwa wateja, kutuma taarifa muhimu za huduma na kuboresha vipengele vyetu. Hatuuzi data yako binafsi au ya biashara kwa watu wengine, wala hatuitumii kukutangazia.">We use your information to operate the Service, record sales, generate fiscal receipts built to the TRA VFD specification, pass orders between a shop and its customers, provide customer support, send important service notices and improve our features. We do not sell your personal or business data to third parties, and we do not use it to advertise to you.</p>

  <h2 data-en="Payments" data-sw="Malipo">Payments</h2>
  <p data-en="BiasharaPOS does not process payments and does not hold card details. When a sale is paid by M-Pesa, Mixx by Yas, Airtel Money, cash or card, the money moves through the business’s own account or terminal, and we record only which method was used and any reference number entered." data-sw="BiasharaPOS haishughulikii malipo wala haihifadhi taarifa za kadi. Mauzo yanapolipwa kwa M-Pesa, Mixx by Yas, Airtel Money, pesa taslimu au kadi, pesa hupita kwenye akaunti au mashine ya biashara yenyewe, na sisi tunarekodi tu njia iliyotumika na namba ya kumbukumbu iliyoingizwa.">BiasharaPOS does not process payments and does not hold card details. When a sale is paid by M-Pesa, Mixx by Yas, Airtel Money, cash or card, the money moves through the business’s own account or terminal, and we record only which method was used and any reference number entered.</p>

  <h2 data-en="Who else sees your data" data-sw="Nani mwingine anaona data yako">Who else sees your data</h2>
  <p data-en="We share data only with the providers that run parts of the Service for us, and only as far as each needs:" data-sw="Tunashiriki data tu na watoa huduma wanaoendesha sehemu za Huduma kwa niaba yetu, na kwa kadri kila mmoja anavyohitaji:">We share data only with the providers that run parts of the Service for us, and only as far as each needs:</p>
  <ul>
    <li data-en="Hosting and database providers, who store the Service and its data." data-sw="Watoa huduma wa uhifadhi na hifadhidata, wanaohifadhi Huduma na data yake.">Hosting and database providers, who store the Service and its data.</li>
    <li data-en="A messaging provider, which delivers the text messages we send about orders and receipts, and therefore receives the recipient’s phone number and the message." data-sw="Mtoa huduma wa ujumbe, anayepeleka ujumbe tunaotuma kuhusu oda na risiti, hivyo anapokea namba ya simu ya mpokeaji na ujumbe wenyewe.">A messaging provider, which delivers the text messages we send about orders and receipts, and therefore receives the recipient’s phone number and the message.</li>
    <li data-en="An artificial-intelligence provider, which powers the chat assistant on this website. Whatever you type into that chat window is sent to them to generate a reply — so please do not put passwords, payment details or anyone’s personal information into it." data-sw="Mtoa huduma wa akili bandia, anayeendesha msaidizi wa mazungumzo kwenye tovuti hii. Chochote unachoandika kwenye dirisha hilo la mazungumzo hutumwa kwake ili kuzalisha jibu — hivyo tafadhali usiweke manenosiri, taarifa za malipo wala taarifa binafsi za mtu yeyote humo.">An artificial-intelligence provider, which powers the chat assistant on this website. Whatever you type into that chat window is sent to them to generate a reply — so please do not put passwords, payment details or anyone’s personal information into it.</li>
    <li data-en="An analytics provider, which measures how this website is used. See our Cookie Policy for details and how to limit it." data-sw="Mtoa huduma wa takwimu, anayepima jinsi tovuti hii inavyotumika. Angalia Sera yetu ya Vidakuzi kwa maelezo na jinsi ya kupunguza.">An analytics provider, which measures how this website is used. See our Cookie Policy for details and how to limit it.</li>
  </ul>
  <p data-en="Some of these providers operate outside Tanzania, so your data may be processed abroad. We also disclose information to the Tanzania Revenue Authority where fiscalisation requires it, and otherwise where the law requires it." data-sw="Baadhi ya watoa huduma hawa wanafanya kazi nje ya Tanzania, hivyo data yako inaweza kushughulikiwa nje ya nchi. Pia tunafichua taarifa kwa Mamlaka ya Mapato Tanzania pale utozaji kodi unapohitaji, na pale sheria inapohitaji.">Some of these providers operate outside Tanzania, so your data may be processed abroad. We also disclose information to the Tanzania Revenue Authority where fiscalisation requires it, and otherwise where the law requires it.</p>

  <h2 data-en="Data security &amp; retention" data-sw="Usalama na uhifadhi wa data">Data security &amp; retention</h2>
  <p data-en="We protect your data with encryption in transit, access controls, and database rules that keep each business’s records separate from every other business’s. Sales and fiscal records are retained for as long as required by Tanzanian tax law. You can request deletion of your account data, subject to those legal retention obligations." data-sw="Tunalinda data yako kwa usimbaji wakati wa usafirishaji, udhibiti wa ufikiaji, na kanuni za hifadhidata zinazotenganisha kumbukumbu za kila biashara na nyingine zote. Kumbukumbu za mauzo na kodi zinahifadhiwa kwa muda unaohitajika na sheria ya kodi ya Tanzania. Unaweza kuomba kufutwa kwa data ya akaunti yako, kwa kuzingatia wajibu huo wa kisheria wa uhifadhi.">We protect your data with encryption in transit, access controls, and database rules that keep each business’s records separate from every other business’s. Sales and fiscal records are retained for as long as required by Tanzanian tax law. You can request deletion of your account data, subject to those legal retention obligations.</p>

  <h2 data-en="Your rights" data-sw="Haki zako">Your rights</h2>
  <p data-en="Under Tanzania’s Personal Data Protection Act, you may access, correct or export your data, and ask us to delete information we are not legally required to keep. You can stop order messages at any time by replying STOP, or ACHA in Swahili. To exercise any of these rights, contact us at the address below — and if you ordered from a shop running on BiasharaPOS, contact that shop first." data-sw="Chini ya Sheria ya Ulinzi wa Data Binafsi ya Tanzania, unaweza kufikia, kurekebisha au kupakua data yako, na kutuomba tufute taarifa ambazo hatutakiwi kisheria kuzihifadhi. Unaweza kusimamisha ujumbe wa oda wakati wowote kwa kujibu STOP, au ACHA kwa Kiswahili. Ili kutumia haki hizi, wasiliana nasi kupitia anwani iliyo hapa chini — na kama uliagiza kutoka duka linalotumia BiasharaPOS, wasiliana na duka hilo kwanza.">Under Tanzania’s Personal Data Protection Act, you may access, correct or export your data, and ask us to delete information we are not legally required to keep. You can stop order messages at any time by replying STOP, or ACHA in Swahili. To exercise any of these rights, contact us at the address below — and if you ordered from a shop running on BiasharaPOS, contact that shop first.</p>

  <h2 data-en="Contact us" data-sw="Wasiliana nasi">Contact us</h2>
  <p data-en={'Questions about this policy? Email us at <a href="mailto:hello@biashara-pos.com">hello@biashara-pos.com</a>.'} data-sw={'Maswali kuhusu sera hii? Tutumie barua pepe <a href="mailto:hello@biashara-pos.com">hello@biashara-pos.com</a>.'}>Questions about this policy? Email us at <a href="mailto:hello@biashara-pos.com">hello@biashara-pos.com</a>.</p>
</LegalLayout>
